---
title: Sequence Diagrams - (a) Bank Chat, (b) Optional Agent Add-On
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Client
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Express API
    participant WS as WebSocket
    participant LLM as Qwen3-8B
    participant MCP as MCP Tools
    participant SC as Contract

    rect rgb(245,245,245)
        Note over U,WS: (a) Client-bank chat (core path)
        U->>FE: Open support thread
        FE->>API: Authenticate + open WS
        API->>WS: Subscribe thread
        U->>FE: Message to approver
        FE->>API: POST /chat
        Note right of API: persist CHAT_MESSAGE
        API-->>U: Deliver via WebSocket
    end

    rect rgb(238,238,238)
        Note over U,SC: (b) Optional MCP agent (Phase III-IV, not MVT)
        U->>FE: Apply for 150 USDC loan
        FE->>API: Stream message (SSE)
        Note right of API: inject on-chain context
        API->>LLM: /v1/chat/completions
        LLM-->>API: Confirmation summary
        API-->>U: Proceed? EMI 26.25 USDC
        U->>FE: Yes, proceed
        Note right of API: log confirmation_turn_id
        API->>MCP: submit_loan_application
        MCP->>API: POST /api/loan/apply
        API->>SC: applyLoan (wallet or session key)
        SC-->>U: Loan submitted L-4821
        Note over API,MCP: HTTP 403 without confirmation
    end
